### Pareto: accuracy vs TTCS

```
Accuracy
 100% |                                              
      |                                              
      |                                              
      |                                              
      |                                              
      |                                              
      |   B                                     ✗    
      |                                              
  40% |                                              
      +----------------------------------------------→ TTCS
       43.5s                                    1m01s
       A=a  B=b
```

- ⚠️ `a` is **dominated** by `b`: at least as accurate and no slower — the unambiguous alarm
- ✅ `b` is on the Pareto frontier (50% solved, TTCS median 45.0s)

### Per-class winners

| Class | `a` | `b` | Winner |
|---|---:|---:|---|
| bugfix | 100% · 1m00s | 100% · 45.0s | b |
| perf | 0% · — | 0% · — | a |

<sub>Per-solved figures divide each arm's accounted totals (failures included) by its accounted solves; TTCS charges a retried solve with its failed attempts' wall.</sub>
